<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light dark;
  }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Text", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #1e293b;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 4px 12px 12px 12px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    color: #0f172a;
  }
  .ok {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #dcfce7;
    color: #166534;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  p {
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
  }
  .box {
    background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.25);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    margin: 10px 0;
  }
  pre {
    font-family: "SF Mono", Menlo, Monaco, monospace;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    margin: 6px 0 0 0;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  code {
    font-family: "SF Mono", Menlo, Monaco, monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    body { color: #e2e8f0; }
    h1 { color: #f8fafc; }
    .ok { background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2); color: #86efac; }
    .box {
      background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.65);
      border-color: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.22);
    }
    pre { background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85); color: #38bdf8; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <span class="ok">Instalación completada</span>
  <h1>Prism ${VERSION} está listo para usarse</h1>
  <p>
    Abre una nueva ventana de <strong>Terminal</strong> (<code>zsh</code> o <code>bash</code>)
    o la terminal integrada de <strong>VS Code</strong> y verifica la instalación:
  </p>
  <div class="box">
    <strong>Comandos rápidos:</strong>
    <pre>prc --version
prc run /Library/Prism/examples/prueba_nl.pr
prc compile /Library/Prism/examples/reglas_inferencia.pr -d ./out</pre>
  </div>
  <div class="box">
    <strong>Editor recomendado (VS Code / Cursor):</strong>
    <p style="margin: 6px 0 0 0;">
      Instala la extensión oficial <code>absoftwaregroup.prism-lang</code> desde
      el Marketplace de Visual Studio Code para obtener resaltado, snippets y diagnósticos en tiempo real.
    </p>
  </div>
  <p>
    Para desinstalar en cualquier momento, abre <code>/Library/Prism/Desinstalar Prism.command</code>
    o ejecuta <code>sudo /Library/Prism/uninstall.sh</code>.
  </p>
</body>
</html>

